            "group": "text",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "mode": "markdown",
                "content": "Two Chaski filters panels, and nothing to write for them: every control comes from the cross-filters the `quakeFilters` variable declares.\n\n- **Timeline**: press play and a window of a few days slides across the month; the map, the cards and the table follow each step.\n- **The map** loads the month once and filters it on the GPU: the controls reach it through their Mosaic selection, with no query in between.\n- **Filters**: the same filters as a sidebar, each control counted under the others.\n- The two time histograms are **one brush**: move either and the other follows.\n- **Draw an area** on the map and the controls count only the quakes inside it.\n\nAnswered by DuckDB in your browser. **Data**: the [USGS real-time feed](https://earthquake.usgs.gov/earthquakes/feed/v1.0/geojson.php) of the last 30 days, every magnitude. Public domain."
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
